            "block_id": 10,
            "block_order": 10
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Step 4.Evaluate the term ib $(2L/b)^{0.3}/[A(\\rho_{r}T)^{0.5}]$ ,using the specific impulse and object dimensions from Step 1, the fragment density and toughness from Step 2 and the loaded area from Step 3. With this term, enter Figure 2-251(+) and read the value of 12V/1000$\\dot{(\\rho_{f}/T)}^{0.5}$ from which the velocity is calculated.\n",
